      "params": [],
      "data": {
        "text": "PHONA / QUIET ACCEPTANCE\nNo Audio module. VCA levels = 0.\nSEQ-3 is STOPPED. Press RESET, then RUN.\nTRIGGERS: TRIG -> GATE. Eight short gates per cycle; first trigger at D3.\nCV 1: C D E F G A B C (C3 base). First RUN advances to step 2.\nRESET out -> Phona RESET.\nLFO sine -> VOWEL and NASAL; amounts start at 0.\nBODY: switch M/F on Phona.\nVCO SAW is parked: connect to EXT IN for talkbox.\nPhona OUT -> VCA channel 1.\nRead docs/live-instrument-test.md before adding Audio.\nSave changes to a COPY."
      }
    }
